// Title: Compress Data and Lock With Password for Exfiltration With 7-ZIP
// ID: 9fbf5927-5261-4284-a71d-f681029ea574
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2021-07-27
// Tags: attack.collection, attack.t1560.001
// Description: An adversary may compress or encrypt data that is collected prior to exfiltration using 3rd party utilities
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (((process.command_line like "*_ a *" or process.command_line like "*_ u *")) and ((Description like "*_7-Zip*") or ((process.executable endswith "\\7z.exe" or process.executable endswith "\\7zr.exe" or process.executable endswith "\\7za.exe")) or ((process.pe.original_file_name == "7z.exe" or process.pe.original_file_name == "7za.exe" or process.pe.original_file_name == "7zr.exe"))) and (process.command_line like "*_ -p*"))
